<p>Using demonic forces you create a link of pain from a source creature to a victim for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns.</p><p>Each time the source creature takes damage the victim takes <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">33%, 51%, 62%, 69%, 74%</acronym> of the damage.</p><p>If the victim dies from the effect you gain a burst of energy, reducing all remaining cooldowns by 1.</p>